Agent-02 Volumetric Light & Frosted Glass

LIGHT CHARACTER - Volumetric bloom with depth
5 concentric bloom layers for atmospheric depth:
1. Far haze (900px, blur 80px) - atmospheric presence
2. Outer bloom (600-800px, blur 40-70px) - diffuse aura
3. Mid bloom (350-500px, blur 20-45px) - body/mass of light
4. Inner glow (180-240px, blur 12-27px) - transition to core
5. Core (120-160px, blur 6-16px) - intense center

Color progression by distance:
- Distant: Warm mauve (#C99CAD)
- Near card (scatter): Cool blue (#8FA9B3)
- Core accent: Deep pink (#9C528B) + white hot center
- Each layer intensifies as light nears card

CARD MATERIAL - Frosted translucent glass
- Backdrop filter: blur(20px) + saturation boost
- Layered box shadows: outer glow, depth shadows, inset rim light
- Subtle noise texture overlay (SVG fractal noise, mix-blend-overlay)
- Semi-transparent background (#1a1a1a at 60%)
- Surface feels like etched/frosted glass

Material optical properties:
- Surface reflection gradient follows light position
- Uses all 3 palette colors in gradient (mauve → blue → pink)
- Edge highlights with bloom/glow (box-shadow on 1px lines)
- Enhanced brightness at peak with white center point
- Gradual falloff creates soft catch-light effect

